 The first incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been created by the timed-out request, so I did not open a duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks before it is redeployed, and look into the orchestrator partial failure, since it could affect other rollouts.", "type": "text"}]}]}